<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Navakholo TerraHub Initiative (NTI)</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Minimal Clean Header -->
    <header>
        <div class="header-left">
            <img src="/images/nti.jpg" alt="NTI Logo" class="nti-logo">
            <div class="org-title">
                <h1>Navakholo TerraHub</h1>
                <span>Execution Over Excuses • Skills Over Papers</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <h2>The Radical Economic Revolution of NTI</h2>
        
        <p class="description">
            Welcome to the official archival repository and knowledge base of the Navakholo TerraHub Initiative. Engineered from the ground up to dismantle hardware barriers, empower rural youth through mobile smartphone terminals, and establish a decentralized financial powerhouse across Kenya and beyond.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-divider"></div>

        <div class="architect-subtitle">Architect & Founder</div>
        <div class="architect-name">Ezra Wanyama (THE SMARTPHONE SCIENTIST) — NTI-ETL01</div>

        <div class="cta-btn-wrapper">
            <a href="/register" class="cta-btn">Enter to Explore</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Core Pillars -->
    <div class="container">
        <h3 class="section-title">Core System Pillars</h3>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>1. Smartphone is Classroom</h3>
                <p>Termux mobile terminal operates as your school, lab, and library. Learn remotely without selling land or livestock.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>2. Self-Discipline</h3>
                <p>Strict daily study blocks (10 AM–4 PM & 8 PM–10 PM) with mandatory daily GitHub commits and zero idleness.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>3. Basics First</h3>
                <p>Mastering English Composition and logical reasoning before advancing to Python and full-stack software development.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        NAVAKHOLO TERRAHUB INITIATIVE • BUILT IN TERMUX • 2026
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
